	(text "Gyropup fuse board rev A (D60, task B5): docs/body-fuse-board.md. Generated by hardware/fuse-board/generate.py from design.py."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "450d677a-50a5-5f46-ae08-ebd561bd41eb")
	)
	(text "Fuses: Littelfuse MINI 58V (0997 series, 1 kA at 58 V DC) ONLY, in Littelfuse MINI FL1 holders (58 V DC, 22 A continuous). A 32 V MINI fuse fits the same holder: the silk says 58 V FUSES ONLY at every holder. Pull a fuse only with the pack unplugged (D55)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 234.95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2f704364-598d-569f-ab7e-9fffe26bc78b")
	)
	(text "High-side shunt R1 (1 mOhm) between J1 (from the MRBF load stud) and +BUS: the INA228's inputs stay inside -0.3..85 V of its ground (BUS-, the switched negative) whether the main switch is on or off. Positive current = into the pack (charging); discharge reads negative."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 241.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8ac704a9-035b-5e54-ac12-31f4d6b628de")
	)
	(text "Kelvin taps (R1 pads 2, 3) at Bourns' measurement points; 10 Ohm in each input (TI SLYS021A 8.1.4); VBUS through 4.7 kOhm from the battery side."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 247.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0485c13b-7c44-586e-b2d0-0470804970b8")
	)
	(text "Fit U1 (bare INA228; the I2C pull-ups are on the MCU carrier), or leave it off and wire an Adafruit 5832 (its 15 mOhm shunt removed, VBUS jumper open): VIN+ to TP2, VIN- to TP1, VBUS to TP3, its STEMMA QT lead to the MCU. Not both (both answer at 0x40)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fd162a28-c644-529e-a8d1-7f9b95adc219")
	)
	(text "J17 (JST GH 4-pin) pinout: 1 GND (BUS-), 2 3V3, 3 SDA, 4 SCL (the body makes this lead)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 260.35 0)
		(effects
